> > Or is there a better/safer way to obtain more candles?

An exhaustive list of ways to make candles is: 1) Wishing, 2) Death
drops from monsters the hero killed personally, 3) Polypiling tools,
4) Finding candles generated along with the level.

For example, you can get death drops from pudding farming, throne
farming, or clearing up summon storms. Polypilable tools include all
those chests in rooms, junk tools in the mines, store inventory, and
mirrors carried by nymphs. Excluding the light shop, the chance of
finding at least one stack of candles somewhere on the floor or in a
grave above Medusa's is 98.26%, but it's admittedly a large search
space.


